body: "Overlap audit: core SDK context intents own declarative projections and core read-output sessions own cross-read references and accounting. Existing context-evidence ranks criterion evidence, context-freshness detects source changes, and context-handoff emits handoffs; sibling pm-brief summarizes tracker context, pm-review evaluates review evidence, pm-memory stores memories, and pm-rlm orchestrates inference. None binds caller-declared mandatory tracker fields to all four explicit task phases with fail-closed budgeting and per-field phase-switch explanations. This feature composes existing SDK reads, intents, omission receipts and sessions. Phase selection grants no agent authority and performs no lifecycle transition."
